[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2451250419","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98713#issuecomment-2451250419","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98713","id":2451250419,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SGxzz","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-01T04:01:27Z","updated_at":"2024-11-01T04:01:27Z","body":"Thanks very much for your quick fix.\r\n\r\nBTW, I just figured out that unbind() can not only discard the arguments passed to the `call()` or `callv()`, but also the arguments bound by the `bind()` which is chained **after** `unbind()`. I will mention this under my issue page because I wrote that \r\n```\r\nSo my opinion is `get_bound_arguments_count` and `get_bound_arguments` should not be influenced by unbind() calls.\r\n```\r\nwhich is not that accurate.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2451250419/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2451567279","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98713#issuecomment-2451567279","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98713","id":2451567279,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SH_Kv","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-01T09:15:39Z","updated_at":"2024-11-01T09:17:08Z","body":"I will try to give a formal proof of why this works and why we first remove unbound arguments and then add bound ones, and not vice versa.\r\n\r\n**1\\. Successive calls of the same name can be reduced to the form `.bind(...).unbind(...)`.**\r\n\r\n1.1. `.bind(A).bind(B)` can be reduced to `.bind(B, A)`, i.e. `.bind(B, A).unbind(0)`.\r\n\r\n1.2. `.unbind(N).unbind(M)` can be reduced to `.unbind(N + M)`, i.e. `.bind().unbind(N + M)`.\r\n\r\n**2\\. Successive calls of different names can be reduced to the form `.bind(...).unbind(...)`.**\r\n\r\n2.1. `.bind(A).unbind(N)` cannot be reduced.\r\n\r\n2.2. `.unbind(N).bind(A)` can be reduced to `.unbind(N').bind(A')`, where:\r\n\r\n```\r\nR = min(N, A.size())\r\nN' = N - R\r\nA' = A.slice(0, A.size() - R)\r\n```\r\n\r\nSince `R = min(N, A.size())`, either `N' = 0` or `A'.size() = 0`.\r\n\r\nSo, `.unbind(N).bind(A)` can be reduced either to `.unbind(N')` or `.bind(A')`, i.e. `bind().unbind(N')` or `.bind(A').unbind(0)`.\r\n\r\n**3\\. Any sequence of `bind()` and `unbind()` calls can be reduced to the form `.bind(...).unbind(...)`.**\r\n\r\n`.bind(A).unbind(N).bind(B).unbind(M)` can be reduced to `.bind(A).unbind(N').bind(B').unbind(M)` (2.2).\r\n\r\nSo, it will be either `.bind(A).unbind(N').unbind(M)` or `.bind(A).bind(B').unbind(M)` (2.2).\r\n\r\nSo, it will be either `.bind(A).unbind(N' + M)` (1.2) or `.bind(B', A).unbind(M)` (1.1).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2451567279/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2451717650","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98713#issuecomment-2451717650","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98713","id":2451717650,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SIj4S","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-01T11:20:22Z","updated_at":"2024-11-01T11:20:22Z","body":"Very impresive! I hope your summarization can be added on the Godot's documentation which can help many users to better understand the design of bind and unbind.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2451717650/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2454936310","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98713#issuecomment-2454936310","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98713","id":2454936310,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SU1r2","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-04T14:57:33Z","updated_at":"2024-11-04T14:57:33Z","body":"> Assuming the current behavior of chained `Callable.bind/Callable.unbind` calls is correct / we don't want to change that, this fix looks correct to me.\r\n\r\nI think we can evaluate down the line exactly the desired behavior, but I think maintaining the behavior of those, as it is at least useful, is more important than these methods, I would say more people would be affected by changes to the binding behavior","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2454936310/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2471256724","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98713#issuecomment-2471256724","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98713","id":2471256724,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TTGKU","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.co